## What's New

<!-- Description with !BLOG_LINK! -->

See the [release post](https://www.ag-grid.com/blog/whats-new-in-ag-charts-15/) for feature highlights of what's new in this major version.

Users of integrated charting on AG Grid, should refer to this migration guide when upgrading to AG Grid {% gridVersion() %}.

